    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/478e74fdb2bf276305f107877ed14226.poster.avif?t=1754083141\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/478e74fdb2bf276305f107877ed14226.webm?t=1754083141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/478e74fdb2bf276305f107877ed14226.mp4?t=1754083141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been assigned to a village on the brink of destruction. <br>Train yourself and deploy units. <br>Make good use of dungeon mechanisms to protect the village. <br>In this real-time strategy tower defense game filled with challenge and depth, recruit unique combat units, use items, collect gear, and build your own line of defense to resist waves of evil creatures. <br>Survive for 7 days! <br>We welcome your experience and feedback.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/478e74fdb2bf276305f107877ed14226.poster.avif?t=1754083141\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/478e74fdb2bf276305f107877ed14226.webm?t=1754083141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/478e74fdb2bf276305f107877ed14226.mp4?t=1754083141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been assigned to a village on the brink of destruction. <br>Train yourself and deploy units. <br>Make good use of dungeon mechanisms to protect the village. <br>In this real-time strategy tower defense game filled with challenge and depth, recruit unique combat units, use items, collect gear, and build your own line of defense to resist waves of evil creatures. <br>Survive for 7 days! <br>We welcome your experience and feedback.</p>",
    "short_description": "A solo-developed tower defense game. You\u2019re sent to a doomed village where monsters from deep underground threaten innocent lives. Deploy units, strengthen defenses, and stop the invasion. Fail\u2014and the village will fall into ruin.",
